OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785998876
OL,3,CSuspected human remains discovered
OL,4,Cnext to motorway
OL,6,FSuspected human remains have been
OL,7,Ffound close to a busy motorway.
OL,9,FOfficers were called shortly after
OL,10,F11pm on Monday, 3 August 2026, after
OL,11,Froad workers made the discovery close
OL,12,Fto a bridge on the M67 in Tameside.
OL,14,FThe road remains closed between
OL,15,Fbetween junctions 3 at Hyde and 4 at
OL,16,FHattersley, while detectives carry out
OL,17,Ftheir work at the scene.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
