OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785998876
OL,3,CSuspected human remains discovered
OL,4,Cnext to motorway
OL,6,FIn a statement, Greater Manchester
OL,7,FPolice said: "We are working with
OL,8,Fspecialist teams to understand the
OL,9,Fcircumstances behind this incident.
OL,11,F"The road will be closed between
OL,12,Fjunctions 3 and 4 while detectives
OL,13,Fcarry out their investigation. Please
OL,14,Fcontinue to avoid the area and we will
OL,15,Fprovide updates when we have them."
OL,17,FPolice say the road is expected to be
OL,18,Fclosed to drivers for the majority of
OL,19,Fthe day and diversions are in place,
OL,20,Fwith National Highways supporting the
OL,21,Fwork by maintaining traffic management.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
