OL,3,CSuspected human remains discovered
OL,4,Cnext to motorway
OL,6,FA spokesperson from National Highways
OL,7,Fsaid: "If this closure impacts on your
OL,8,Fplanned route, please allow extra
OL,9,Fjourney time. Plan ahead, you may wish
OL,10,Fto re-route or even delay your
OL,11,Fjourney."
